<title>UK: IFC sets 100 million rand five-year bond. [CORRECTED 10:04 GMT]</title>
<headline>IFC sets 100 million rand five-year bond. [CORRECTED 10:04 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTERNATIONAL FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     14.75     MATURITY    25.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.475   PAY DATE    25.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.85     SPREAD	 =</p>
<p>(Lead manager corrects FULL FEES from 1.625)</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
